    <td style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(6)</span></td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Includes 4,199,590 shares issuable
    upon conversion of 419,959 shares of Series B Preferred Stock (each convertible into 10 shares of common stock). The address of the
    stockholder is No. 211, Wen Hwa 2nd Rd., Kuei Shan, Tao Yuan 33377, Taiwan, Republic of China.</span></td></tr>
