</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;">
  <tr style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 5%; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(3)</span></td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; width: 95%; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">These
    options were granted under our 2014 option plan and were related to our one year salary deferral program that commenced in May 2024
    where each officer&#8217;s cash salary was reduced, and cliff vested on April 30, 2025.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; white-space: nowrap; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt">(4)</td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt">These options were granted under our 2014 option plan and were related equity performance bonuses for meeting certain target elements
under the management incentive bonus program for 2023 in lieu of cash payments.</td></tr>
  </table><div>
