    <td style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">four times
    his annual base salary, payable in forty-eight (48) equal monthly installments</span></td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: bottom; width: 1%"><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: bottom; width: 1%"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">$</span></td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12%; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1,863,000</span></td>
