                                            Chair Fees</span></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style=" font-size: 10pt">&#9726;</span><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#160;
    Audit</span></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style=" font-size: 10pt">&#9726;</span><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#160;
    All other committees</span></p></td>
    <td style="border-right: black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 0.05in"><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
